  137: #  HOW THE IMAGE IS ATTACHED, as a parameter rather than a hardcode.  The measuring
  138: #  seat that found the m3 escape had to SHIM run_one() to reach the CD-ROM prefix,
  139: #  and said so; a companion probe that needs `ciR:` sets this instead.  The prefix is
